        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Roll The Bones"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nThe bone croupier designates an adjacent living creature to roll the bones. The chosen creature finds a pair of dice in its hand and is compelled by fate to roll them; it can and must roll the dice even if its hands are full or it is unable to act. The creature rolls 2d6, adding them together to determine the effect.\n\n7 or 11 (healing, positive) The target regains 15 HP.\n\n2, 3, or 12 (negative) The target takes 30 negative damage. If the target is dying, this damage increases its dying condition by 2 instead of 1."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
